[{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32000800_03_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32000800_03_0010","text":"学校怎么样？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32000800_03_0020","text":"被撞了"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32000800_03_0030","text":"被撞了，\n之前你也说过类似的话────"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32000800_03_0040","text":"嗯——"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32000800_03_0045","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32000800_03_0049","text":"女学生"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32000800_03_0050","text":"那个……\n之前真是抱歉……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32000800_03_0060","text":"我一直是粉丝，因为太崇拜了不敢靠近，\n但是，我想鼓起勇气──"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32000800_03_0070","text":"就来撞了……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32000800_03_0075","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32000800_03_0080","text":"哈哈，原来如此\n那透是怎么回答的？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32000800_03_0090","text":"说了谢谢"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32000800_03_0100","text":"哈哈，是吗"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32000800_03_0110","text":"确实，有种要撞上来的气势呢\n大家的热情"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32000800_03_0120","text":"透没有感受过吗？\n在演唱会之类的场合，那种像是力量的东西"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32000800_03_0130","text":"啊——\n力量"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32000800_03_0140","text":"透有吗？\n想要撞上去的东西"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32000800_03_0150","text":"（那种程度的、透倾注热情的东西──）"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32000800_03_0155","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32000800_03_0160","text":"嗯——怎么说呢"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32000800_03_0170","text":"总之先选制作人可以吗？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32000800_03_0180","text":"诶，总之？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32000800_03_0190","text":"砰"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32000800_03_0200","text":"喂喂，正在开车呢……！"}]
